<opsproc code="00008981.0001001" revdate="2014-02-04T21:05:31"><title><abb>DC</abb> Main Generation (<abb>TR</abb> 1 inoperative)</title><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.017"><title>Flight preparation/Limitations</title><procbody lid="N.00008981.0001001.018"><inform layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.019"><para code="00008981.0001001.010" layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.020">Maximum
landing capability is CAT 3 SINGLE.</para></inform></procbody></procitem><procitem layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.008"><title>During preliminary cockpit preparation</title><procbody lid="N.00008981.0001001.009"><action layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.011" memory="false"><cr-action code="00008981.0001001.006"><challenge><tech-label type="cb">TR 1/CNTOR/SPLY (125VU CF01)</tech-label></challenge><response>Pull</response></cr-action><comment code="00008981.0001001.012"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.023">On the <tech-label type="s-page">ELEC</tech-label>, disregard the indications related to the deactivated <abb>TR </abb>1.</para></comment></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.012" memory="false"><command code="00008981.0001001.007"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.013">On the <tech-label type="s-page">ELEC</tech-label>, check that the <abb>TR</abb> 2 and the <abb>ESS</abb> <abb>TR</abb> voltages are both equal to or above <measure category="Electricity" show-unit="true" system="SI" unit="V">27</measure>.</para></command></action><action layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.014" memory="false"><command code="00008981.0001001.008"><para layer="1" lid="N.00008981.0001001.015">The batteries must be set to
OFF for the following check: On the battery voltage indicator, check
that the <abb>BAT</abb> 1 and the <abb>BAT</abb> 2 voltages are both
equal to or above <measure category="Electricity" show-unit="true" system="SI" unit="V">25.5</measure>.</para></command></action></procbody></procitem></opsproc>